      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "child_arrest_stereotype",
      "label": "Stereotype of children being arrested for trivial offenses",
      "description": "A satirical or exaggerated trope that plays on the idea of law enforcement overreach or absurdity by imagining children being arrested for minor or nonsensical reasons. This meme uses this trope to create humor through incongruity, implying the child is being arrested for something trivial or nonsensical.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
