      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme's humor relies on the absurdity of applying a serious legal concept (public intoxication) to a child, which could be seen as trivializing law enforcement actions or undermining trust in authority. While not targeting any specific group with hate or abuse, the meme's harmful potential lies in its potential to normalize or trivialize law enforcement actions, especially when applied to children, which could be seen as undermining trust in authority or promoting a cynical view of policing.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
